# Party banter that follows the companions' personal quests anywhere in the valley (story/banter.gd plays
# banter/party* files in every region). Each node opens with an `if` gate; only present members speak, so a node a
# custom hero's party can't voice is skipped. docs/story/personal_quests.md.

~ banter_jory
if flag.kestrel_jory_met and not flag.kestrel_vell_met
interject name:tamsin_tealeaf: He ran, Ilse. From that. I'd have run. I'd have run so fast I'd have left my shadow behind to cover for me.
interject name:ilse_varga: Running's allowed. Not coming back's the problem. He came back as far as he could. Vallaki's as far as he could.
endif
-> END

~ banter_after_vell
if flag.kestrel_vell_rests
interject name:hedda_ironvow: He held still for you, Ilse. At the end. I saw it.
interject name:ilse_varga: He was a good corporal. Bad with knots. Good with a tally. Hold the line, Hedda.
interject name:hedda_ironvow: Mm. I am holding it.
endif
-> END

~ banter_couriers
if flag.locket_arrigal_confirmed
interject name:silvain_aster: A man who leaves bait on a carriage seat and waits a season for the right fool. Patient. Literate. I'd almost admire him if he weren't such a dreadful correspondent.
interject name:tamsin_tealeaf: I'm the right fool, in this story. Thank you, Silvain.
interject name:silvain_aster: You're the only fool in this story who's going to choose the ending. That's not nothing.
endif
-> END

~ banter_locket_returned
if flag.locket_fate == "pool"
interject name:ilse_varga: You gave it back. Didn't think you had it in you, thief.
interject name:tamsin_tealeaf: Neither did I. I keep checking my pockets. It's like losing a tooth.
endif
-> END

~ banter_locket_ireena
if flag.locket_fate == "ireena" and guest:ireena
interject name:tamsin_tealeaf: She opens it when she thinks nobody's looking. Then she smiles, and then she stops smiling. Then she opens it again.
interject name:hedda_ironvow: Mm. That's remembering, little thief. It looks like that, from outside.
endif
-> END

~ banter_locket_kept
if flag.locket_fate == "kept"
interject name:hedda_ironvow: You still carry it.
interject name:tamsin_tealeaf: I still carry it. I'm a thief. We're very bad at giving things back. It's in the contract.
interject name:hedda_ironvow: Mm. And you're very good at lying about why. That isn't.
endif
-> END

~ banter_warmth
if quest.cold_prayers >= warmth
interject name:tamsin_tealeaf: Hedda's humming. I didn't know Hedda hummed. Hedda, you're humming.
interject name:hedda_ironvow: Mm. I'm allowed. It's a hymn. Mostly.
endif
-> END

~ banter_aurel_alive
if quest.aurels_last_chapter >= still_reading
interject name:ilse_varga: The scholar. Your friend. We get him out. That's the plan, start to finish.
interject name:silvain_aster: That is the shortest plan I have ever heard, and I find I have nothing to add. Thank you, Ilse.
endif
-> END
